        <mxCell id="c8" value="&lt;b&gt;The inventories absorbed 8,754,515.25&lt;/b&gt;, nearly twice the 4,503,611.24 the year earned. The growth of the recorded sales tax payable (1,932,519.29) and of the payables (821,074.85) held cash up; the steps end at the change in cash, −941,310.30." style="rounded=0;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E8F6F3;strokeColor=#E8F6F3;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#2C3E50;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="238" y="16" width="606" height="59" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
