        <mxCell id="c148" value="&lt;i&gt;Report view, page Cash Bridge, with the slicer saved on 2026 (filtered to the window&#x27;s complete years, 2024 to 2026), the Cash step filtered out and the steps in their sort order. Power BI adds the Total column, the change in cash. Outlined in ink: the Inventories step, in the waterfall and in the matrix; in coral: financing and investing of 2026, as recorded and restated. Matrix rows follow their sort, the restated sections by name; grand-total columns, the cash cards, the table of cash by year and the page&#x27;s text box are not drawn.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="769" width="860" height="68" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
